---
/**
 * Giscus comment component.
 * Uses GitHub Discussions for comments on blog posts.
 *
 * Setup required:
 * 1. Enable Discussions on the GitHub repo (ilmagnificho/yoongjae.com)
 * 2. Install giscus app: https://github.com/apps/giscus
 * 3. Configure at https://giscus.app with repo: ilmagnificho/yoongjae.com
 */
---

<section class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-ink/10">
  <h2 class="font-serif text-lg font-semibold mb-4">댓글</h2>
  <div id="giscus-container">
    <script
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo="ilmagnificho/yoongjae.com"
      data-repo-id=""
      data-category="Comments"
      data-category-id=""
      data-mapping="pathname"
      data-strict="0"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme="light"
      data-lang="ko"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
  </div>
  <p class="text-[11px] text-ink/30 mt-3">
    댓글은 <a href="https://github.com/ilmagnificho/yoongjae.com/discussions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-ink/50 transition-colors underline">GitHub Discussions</a>를 통해 관리됩니다. GitHub 계정으로 로그인하여 댓글을 남길 수 있습니다.
  </p>
</section>
